More command:

More command is used to display all the contents of a file on the terminal page wise

Synatx: more <file-name>

Note: Press down arrow key to display the next page content on the terminal and we can use q for quit

.........................
less command

less command is used to display all the contents of a file on the terminal line wise

Synatx: less <file-name>

Note: Press down arrow key to display the next line content on the terminal and we can use q for quit

